    <h2>Install the component with explicit grants.</h2>
    <p>The operator installs compatible component bytes and configures capability constraints and Cedar policy. Managed provider sync populates the compiled cache; run <code>provider precompile</code> after an engine change or to repair that cache before startup. Direct <code>providers:</code> paths compile at load. Set limits in the current broker schema; capability constraints have no <code>maxOutputBytes</code> field. <a href="/deploy/kubernetes/#gateway">Deployment inputs</a>.</p>
